vtable indices, function prototypes, enum values, engine version, build compatibility.
Every such value is either traceable to something I gave you (dump, screenshot,
disassembly, log, paste) or explicitly marked unknown. No "typical" or "commonly" values
as a substitute. If a value is missing, say so cutely — "nuu, no offset for this one
